# P0-5 (CEO audit 2026-07-01): keep /admin out of the index. AuthGuard
# remains the real authz (session lives in localStorage, unreachable by the
# edge); this just prevents the admin surface from being crawlable/
# discoverable. _headers path scopes ARE honored on Cloudflare Pages
# (verified: the global /* block above is served on prod). A Next.js
# middleware approach was tried in 7adbd875 and REVERTED in 9c71e60b —
# @cloudflare/next-on-pages requires every route to declare runtime='edge'
# once middleware exists (~250 file changes), so middleware is unusable
# on this stack. _headers is the build-safe path.
/admin/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
